  "solution": {
    "text": "Given $\\cos ^{2} 75^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 45^{\\circ}+\\cos ^{2} 15^{\\circ}-\\cos ^{2} 30^{\\circ}\\cos^260^\\circ$\r\n$=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2 \\sqrt{2}}-\\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{2}}\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2 \\sqrt{2}}+\\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{2}}\\right)^{2}$ $-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)^{2}-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}$\r\n$=\\left(\\frac{3+1-2 \\sqrt{3}}{8}\\right)+\\frac{1}{2}+\\left(\\frac{3+1+2 \\sqrt{3}}{8}\\right)-\\frac{3}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}$\r\n$=\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}+\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}-\\frac{3}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{3}{2}-1=\\frac{1}{2}$"
  }
